flowchart TD
    A([HR identifies employee transfer])
    --> B[Select Employee]

    B --> C[Select Source Company]

    C --> D[Select Destination Company]

    D --> E[Define destination assignment]

    E --> F[Set Effective Date]

    F --> G{Destination setup valid?}

    G -->|No| H[Resolve missing Company /<br/>organizational configuration]

    H --> G

    G -->|Yes| I[Submit transfer]

    I --> J[Transfer = Pending]

    J --> K[Employee continues working<br/>under Source Company]

    K --> L{Effective Date reached?}

    L -->|No| K

    L -->|Yes| M[Source Company employment<br/>becomes historical]

    M --> N[Destination Company employment<br/>becomes current]

    N --> O[Related organizational access<br/>and business context transition]

    O --> P[Historical Source Company<br/>records remain available]

    P --> Q([Transfer completed])